  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile setups (config_018: 0.6186 accuracy) and RNA-only scvi_n200 (config_005: 0.6501 accuracy) perform best. This experiment tests multimodal multiprofile with scvi_n200 RNA (a more complex encoder than pca_n2000) and resnet50 images, using avgpool aggregation (proven effective in config_018). It isolates the impact of RNA encoder complexity vs multimodal integration, addressing uncertainty about whether scvi_n200's benefits outweigh image data addition. This balances exploitation of promising RNA encoder complexity (config_005) with exploration of multimodal potential."
}

